@startuml SM1
!include style.iuml
hide empty description
[*] --> Idle
Idle --> CredentialRead : scan credential QR
CredentialRead --> Rejected : [signature invalid OR expired\nOR revoked OR unparseable\nOR list older than hard limit]
CredentialRead --> ChallengeShown : [valid AND level = L2]
CredentialRead --> AwaitingFaceCheck : [valid AND level = L1]
ChallengeShown --> AwaitingFaceCheck : [holder signature valid]
ChallengeShown --> Rejected : [holder signature invalid\nOR timeout 60 s]
AwaitingFaceCheck --> Accepted : [agent confirms match]
AwaitingFaceCheck --> Rejected : [agent rejects match]
Accepted --> RecordQueued : / append record
Rejected --> RecordQueued : / append record
RecordQueued --> Idle : next farmer
@enduml
